    <string name="games_howto_wallet_persona">From your first move on payday to what has been sitting in your cart for months — ten questions, one read on your wallet\'s personality.</string>
    <string name="games_howto_spend_duel">Thirty either-or moments with no right answer. Pick your way through and your spending style shows up.</string>
    <string name="games_howto_receipt_guess">Look at an item on a receipt and guess what it cost. The real price is revealed right after.</string>
    <string name="games_howto_blind_box">No exact numbers — just pick a price band. Eight blind boxes, and how close you land.</string>
    <string name="games_howto_daily_tasks">Ten little tasks drawn at random. Each one you do counts — no streaks, no judgement.</string>
    <string name="games_howto_save_challenge">Eight everyday scenes, each with a thriftier option. See how much this round saves.</string>
    <string name="games_howto_ledger_quiz">Fifteen true-or-false questions from the ledger\'s trivia drawer. Every answer comes with an explanation.</string>
    <string name="games_howto_spend_radar">Five quick scales draw your five-sided money map: planning, impulse, social, experience, minimalism.</string>
